WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.425 --> 00:00:18.129
The next morning Sara had a long talk with her doll, Emily, about her father.

2
00:00:18.149 --> 00:00:22.631
"Papa is traveling on the sea now," said Sara.

3
00:00:23.791 --> 00:00:27.392
Emily said nothing, but Sara was sure the doll was listening.

4
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:33.523
"I believe that dolls have secrets," Sara told her maid, Mariette.

5
00:00:34.644 --> 00:00:37.265
"Perhaps Emily can read and walk and talk.

6
00:00:38.346 --> 00:00:41.348
But she only does those things when no one is watching her."

7
00:00:42.729 --> 00:00:44.390
Mariette smiled at Sara.

8
00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.392
"It's time for school."

9
00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:49.774
"Just a minute, please," Sara replied.

10
00:00:51.635 --> 00:00:53.476
She went to Emily and gave her a book.

11
00:00:53.496 --> 00:00:58.920
"You can read this while I'm in class," she said to the doll.

12
00:01:00.072 --> 00:01:01.513
"What an odd child!"

13
00:01:02.054 --> 00:01:04.816
Mariette thought as she and Sara went downstairs.

14
00:01:05.857 --> 00:01:08.960
But Mariette knew she would like her new job as Sara's maid.

15
00:01:10.341 --> 00:01:13.844
Sara was very kind and polite and had charming manners.

16
00:01:13.864 --> 00:01:18.969
"She's almost like a little princess," thought the maid.

17
00:01:20.410 --> 00:01:24.013
By the time Sara entered the classroom, everyone was talking about her.

18
00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:27.296
"She has so many fancy clothes!"

19
00:01:27.712 --> 00:01:30.354
Lavinia Herbert whispered to her best friend, Jessie.

20
00:01:30.374 --> 00:01:33.656
"I passed her room last night.

21
00:01:34.016 --> 00:01:36.718
Her maid was opening a suitcase full of lace petticoats!

22
00:01:37.238 --> 00:01:38.239
She's wearing one now.

23
00:01:38.259 --> 00:01:40.120
I saw it when she sat down."

24
00:01:42.341 --> 00:01:46.344
Lavinia was nearly 13 and thought of herself as almost grown up.

25
00:01:46.364 --> 00:01:52.788
"I heard Miss Minchin say it's absolutely ridiculous for a child to have such fancy clothes," she said.

26
00:01:53.828 --> 00:01:54.649
"I agree with her.

27
00:01:55.209 --> 00:01:58.071
My mother says that children should always dress simply."

28
00:02:01.494 --> 00:02:04.175
The two girls pretended to read their geography books.

29
00:02:05.276 --> 00:02:07.558
But they were really sneaking looks at Sara.

30
00:02:07.578 --> 00:02:10.840
"She's wearing silk stockings!"

31
00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:12.201
whispered Jessie.

32
00:02:12.221 --> 00:02:14.683
"What tiny feet she has!"

33
00:02:16.464 --> 00:02:17.885
"I don't think she's pretty at all."

34
00:02:18.285 --> 00:02:19.146
Lavinia sniffed.

35
00:02:20.146 --> 00:02:22.068
"Her eyes are such a strange color."

36
00:02:24.228 --> 00:02:28.369
"But there's something about her that makes you keep looking at her," said Jessie.

37
00:02:29.289 --> 00:02:33.871
"Her eyelashes are so dark and long, and her eyes are almost green."

38
00:02:35.031 --> 00:02:39.732
Meanwhile Sara sat quietly watching the other girls, who were still staring at her.

39
00:02:39.752 --> 00:02:43.533
"Young ladies," said Miss Minchin.

40
00:02:44.374 --> 00:02:48.955
"I'd like to introduce you to your new classmate, Miss Sara Crewe."

41
00:02:50.675 --> 00:02:53.056
All the girls stood up, and Sara did too.

42
00:02:54.216 --> 00:02:56.677
"I expect you to be nice to Miss Crewe.

43
00:02:57.138 --> 00:02:59.579
She's just come to London from India.

44
00:03:00.059 --> 00:03:03.981
After lessons are over, you will have time to get acquainted with Sara."

45
00:03:05.922 --> 00:03:09.044
The girls bowed to Sara, who curtsied in reply.

46
00:03:09.064 --> 00:03:14.047
"Come here, Sara," said Miss Minchin as the other girls sat down.

47
00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:17.589
Sara obediently went to Miss Minchin's side.

48
00:03:17.609 --> 00:03:22.972
"Your father hired a French maid for you," said the headmistress.

49
00:03:24.064 --> 00:03:26.245
"He must want you to learn French."

50
00:03:28.006 --> 00:03:29.466
Sara felt a little awkward.

51
00:03:29.486 --> 00:03:34.669
"I think he just thought that I'd like Mariette," she replied politely.

52
00:03:35.849 --> 00:03:37.110
Miss Minchin frowned.

53
00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:39.391
"You sound very spoiled.

54
00:03:39.871 --> 00:03:42.792
People don't always do things just to make you happy, Sara.

55
00:03:43.272 --> 00:03:45.693
Your father clearly wants you to learn French."

56
00:03:47.474 --> 00:03:49.775
Sara flushed, unsure of what to say.

57
00:03:50.695 --> 00:03:52.096
Her mother had been French.

58
00:03:53.388 --> 00:03:56.891
Her father had loved her mother and had often spoken French to Sara.

59
00:03:58.092 --> 00:03:59.993
But Miss Minchin looked so mean.

60
00:04:01.154 --> 00:04:03.336
Sara didn't know how to explain things to her.

61
00:04:03.356 --> 00:04:12.543
"I've never actually studied French," Sara began, "but—" "Well, then it's time you started to study it," the

62
00:04:12.583 --> 00:04:14.124
headmistress said impatiently.

63
00:04:16.166 --> 00:04:18.848
Miss Minchin herself had never learned to speak French.

64
00:04:19.648 --> 00:04:23.311
But this was an embarrassing secret that she didn't intend to share with anyone.

65
00:04:23.331 --> 00:04:27.855
"Here's our French teacher now," she added sharply.

66
00:04:27.875 --> 00:04:32.259
"Everyone, take out your French books."

67
00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:36.382
Monsieur Dufarge looked like a nice, intelligent man.

68
00:04:37.483 --> 00:04:39.085
When he saw Sara he smiled.

69
00:04:39.105 --> 00:04:41.627
"Is this a new pupil for me, Madame?"

70
00:04:42.167 --> 00:04:42.708
he asked.

71
00:04:43.796 --> 00:04:48.759
"Her father—Captain Crewe—is very eager for her to learn the language.

72
00:04:49.219 --> 00:04:55.023
But I'm afraid that Sara seems less eager to learn," Miss Minchin replied with a frown.

73
00:04:56.924 --> 00:05:00.026
Sara rose in her seat, suddenly feeling a bit desperate.

74
00:05:01.047 --> 00:05:04.629
She felt sure that she could explain her situation to Monsieur Dufarge.

75
00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:09.592
And she did exactly that, speaking to him in perfect French.

76
00:05:11.376 --> 00:05:15.580
Miss Minchin started quite violently, and then she glared at Sara.

77
00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:21.725
But Monsieur Dufarge was already charmed by the girl who spoke his language so beautifully.

78
00:05:21.745 --> 00:05:24.767
"Ah, Miss Minchin," he said.

79
00:05:24.787 --> 00:05:27.449
"There isn't much I can teach Sara.

80
00:05:27.909 --> 00:05:29.351
She hasn't studied French.

81
00:05:29.831 --> 00:05:30.992
She is French."

82
00:05:32.373 --> 00:05:34.034
Miss Minchin's cheeks flushed.

83
00:05:34.054 --> 00:05:37.137
"You should have told me!"

84
00:05:37.517 --> 00:05:41.504
the headmistress snapped at Sara.

85
00:05:41.524 --> 00:05:43.326
"I—I tried," said Sara.

86
00:05:43.346 --> 00:05:45.968
"I guess I should have tried harder."

87
00:05:47.229 --> 00:05:50.512
Lavinia and Jessie giggled from behind their French books.

88
00:05:53.395 --> 00:05:56.197
Sara had made the headmistress look a bit foolish.

89
00:05:56.217 --> 00:05:58.580
"Silence, young ladies!"

90
00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.561
Miss Minchin rapped on her desk.

91
00:06:01.762 --> 00:06:05.946
"Silence!" And from that moment on, she began to dislike her new student.
